        <item>
            <title>1.4.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 08:05:40 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/jinkun1998/another.notch/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>42</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<div class="markdown-heading"><h3 class="heading-element">Changes in v1.4.1 (Hotfix)</h3><a id="user-content-changes-in-v141-hotfix" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Changes in v1.4.1 (Hotfix)" href="#changes-in-v141-hotfix"><span aria-hidden="true" class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Lock Screen Idle Detection</strong>: Automatically hides lock screen music widget when avatar and password prompt go idle or screensaver starts; restores widget when user interacts.</li>
<li>
<strong>Instant Unlock Fade</strong>: Fades out lock screen widget immediately upon authentication (<code>com.apple.screenunlock.success</code> and <code>shieldWindowLowered</code>), eliminating post-unlock delay and desktop lingering.</li>
<li>
<strong>Documentation</strong>: Added total downloads badge to README.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href="https://github.com/jinkun1998/another.notch/compare/v1.4.0...v1.4.1">https://github.com/jinkun1998/another.notch/compare/v1.4.0...v1.4.1</a></p>
]]></description>
